sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as :QAController
    participant R as :RetrievalService
    participant H as :ConversationHistory
    participant K as :KeywordIndex
    participant X as :VectorIndex
    participant S as :ContentStore

    C->>R: retrievePassages(query, conversationId)
    Note over R: «Pure Fabrication, Low Coupling»<br/>Retrieval logic lives in one service class,<br/>so the controller never touches the<br/>indexes or the store directly
    opt follow-up question that does not name its subject
        R->>H: getRecentContext(conversationId)
        H-->>R: earlier questions + answers
        R->>R: rewriteQueryWithContext()
        Note over H: «Information Expert»<br/>ConversationHistory owns the earlier<br/>exchanges, so it supplies the context<br/>for the rewrite
    end
    R->>R: normaliseAndExpand(query)<br/>(synonyms, abbreviations, e.g. "MPWT")
    R->>K: search(terms)
    K-->>R: keyword matches
    R->>X: search(queryEmbedding)
    X-->>R: semantic matches
    Note over K,X: «Polymorphism, Protected Variations»<br/>Both indexes implement one SearchIndex<br/>interface — a new search method can be<br/>added without changing RetrievalService
    R->>R: mergeAndRerank(results)
    R->>S: filterCurrentlyEffective(results)
    S-->>R: passages still in effect + source metadata
    Note over S: «Information Expert»<br/>ContentStore holds effective dates and<br/>last-verified dates, so it decides which<br/>content is still current
    alt top score >= relevance threshold
        R-->>C: topPassages + source metadata
    else top score < relevance threshold
        R-->>C: emptyResult (UC-1 continues with «extend» UC-4)
    end
